{"verse_key": "13:30", "surah": 13, "verse": 30, "text_uthmani": "كَذَٰلِكَ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ فِىٓ أُمَّةٍ قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِهَآ أُمَمٌ لِّتَتْلُوَا۟ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ وَهُمْ يَكْفُرُونَ بِٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ۚ قُلْ هُوَ رَبِّى لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ عَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ وَإِلَيْهِ مَتَابِ", "translation": "Thus have We sent you to a community before which [other] communities have passed on so you might recite to them that which We revealed to you, while they disbelieve in the Most Merciful. Say, \"He is my Lord; there is no deity except Him. Upon Him I rely, and to Him is my return.\"", "verse_from_ms": 720880, "verse_to_ms": 759410, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "start_ms": 720880, "end_ms": 722040}, {"i": 1, "text": "أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ", "start_ms": 722040, "end_ms": 723470}, {"i": 2, "text": "فِىٓ", "start_ms": 723470, "end_ms": 725140}, {"i": 3, "text": "أُمَّةٍ", "start_ms": 725140, "end_ms": 727170}, {"i": 4, "text": "قَدْ", "start_ms": 727170, "end_ms": 727470}, {"i": 5, "text": "خَلَتْ", "start_ms": 727470, "end_ms": 728120}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 728120, "end_ms": 729020}, {"i": 7, "text": "قَبْلِهَآ", "start_ms": 729020, "end_ms": 731320}, {"i": 8, "text": "أُمَمٌ", "start_ms": 731320, "end_ms": 732060}, {"i": 9, "text": "لِّتَتْلُوَا۟", "start_ms": 732060, "end_ms": 733000}, {"i": 10, "text": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "start_ms": 733000, "end_ms": 734770}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "start_ms": 734770, "end_ms": 735600}, {"i": 12, "text": "أَوْحَيْنَآ", "start_ms": 735600, "end_ms": 736680}, {"i": 13, "text": "إِلَيْكَ", "start_ms": 736680, "end_ms": 738820}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَهُمْ", "start_ms": 738820, "end_ms": 741730}, {"i": 15, "text": "يَكْفُرُونَ", "start_ms": 741730, "end_ms": 742580}, {"i": 16, "text": "بِٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ", "start_ms": 742580, "end_ms": 743110}, {"i": 17, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 743110, "end_ms": 744330}, {"i